ail":"He held the executive post of Executive Councillor for Open Spaces and City Services.","source":{"title":"Cambridgeshire Live: Meet Sam Carling the North West Cambridgeshire MP who is only 22 (5 July 2024)","url":"https://www.cambridge-news.co.uk/news/local-news/meet-sam-carling-north-west-29481290"}},{"phase":"politics","start":null,"end":null,"title":"Member, Skills Committee","organisation":"Cambridgeshire and Peterborough Combined Authority","detail":"He was a member of the Combined Authority's Skills Committee for two years.","source":{"title":"Cambridgeshire Live: Meet Sam Carling the North West Cambridgeshire MP who is only 22 (5 July 2024)","url":"https://www.cambridge-news.co.uk/news/local-news/meet-sam-carling-north-west-29481290"}},{"phase":"politics","start":"2024-05","end":"2024-05","title":"Reelected councillor for West Chesterton ward","organisation":"Cambridge City Council","detail":"He was reelected for Labour with a majority of 208 votes.","source":{"title":"Varsity: Cambridge postgrad re-elected as City councillor (4 May 2024)","url":"https://www.varsity.co.uk/news/27536"}},{"phase":"politics","start":null,"end":null,"title":"Labour candidate for North West Cambridgeshire","organisation":"Labour Party","detail":"He stood as Labour candidate for North West Cambridgeshire at the 2024 general election.","source":{"title":"Hunts Post: General Election: Labour North West Cambs candidate Cllr Sam Carling","url":"https://www.huntspost.co.uk/news/24349557.general-election-labour-north-west-cambs-candidate-cllr-sam-carling/"}}]$bt$::jsonb::text)),
